WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.190 --> 00:00:02.150
Folks, I have
a simple philosophy.

00:00:03.190 --> 00:00:06.190
The government should work for
everyone, not just the elite.

00:00:07.160 --> 00:00:09.700
And that's why I helped
pass the farm bill,

00:00:09.700 --> 00:00:13.230
because I care about farmers.
But I won't stop there.

00:00:15.040 --> 00:00:20.280
I will work for everyone,
whether you are young,

00:00:21.170 --> 00:00:22.830
whether you are old,

00:00:22.830 --> 00:00:26.430
whether you are Asian
or Hispanic,

00:00:26.430 --> 00:00:29.820
whether you are straight
or whether you are gay.

00:00:31.440 --> 00:00:34.030
I will work for all of you.

00:00:35.070 --> 00:00:37.790
And that's why I also
support marriage equality.

00:00:39.630 --> 00:00:41.570
Folks don't choose to be gay,

00:00:42.550 --> 00:00:44.400
anymore than I choose
to be straight.

00:00:45.680 --> 00:00:48.230
Could you imagine
if someone told you

00:00:49.080 --> 00:00:51.820
that you couldn't marry
the person that you loved?

00:00:53.750 --> 00:00:56.470
I'm sorry, I think
gays are people too.

00:00:57.930 --> 00:01:04.020
Gays are not different.
Gays, they're just like us.

00:01:05.240 --> 00:01:09.240
They love, they fear,
they raise their children,

00:01:09.820 --> 00:01:11.520
they strive for a better life.

00:01:12.270 --> 00:01:15.580
But there are those
who believe that being gay

00:01:16.100 --> 00:01:17.800
is an abomination.

00:01:19.020 --> 00:01:22.760
That's absurd.
The homosexual community

00:01:24.180 --> 00:01:26.840
is a valuable community
in this country.

00:01:28.100 --> 00:01:31.060
They are doctors,
they are lawyers,

00:01:32.070 --> 00:01:38.140
they are teachers,
they are me, and they are you.

00:01:39.760 --> 00:01:42.880
And their contributions
are no less important

00:01:43.770 --> 00:01:47.640
than any other group
in this fine nation of ours.

00:01:50.270 --> 00:01:55.020
So, turn to that gay person
near you,

00:01:56.940 --> 00:02:00.410
and see that they are
no different than you are.

00:02:02.300 --> 00:02:04.000
Thank you.

